      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Today the old station building is being renovated to become part of the Hungarian Technical and Transportation Museum.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Budapest-Kelenf%C3%B6ld_railway_station",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Kelenföld Power Station blends industrial heritage with architectural elegance, a landmark that still sparks curiosity among visitors.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17,
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://aimarketingugynokseg.hu/en/kelenfold-budapests-hidden-gem-of-history/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The large Kelenföld housing estate, built between 1967 and 1983 from pre‑fabricated concrete blocks, defines the neighborhood’s mid‑century character.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
